<import src="../../components/states.wxml"/>
<view class="page"><template is="feedback" data="{{loading,error}}"/><block wx:if="{{!loading && !error}}">
<view class="eyebrow">A GIFT FOR YOUR EFFORT</view><view class="heading">每一份坚持，都有回应。</view><view class="subtitle">收好这些，属于你的小小成就。</view><view wx:if="{{!signedIn}}" class="card section"><view class="empty">登录后查看挑战进度与奖励。</view><button class="btn" data-url="/pages/account/index" bindtap="go">开始模拟体验</button></view><block wx:else><view class="segmented section"><button class="segment {{tab === 'available' ? 'active' : ''}}" data-tab="available" bindtap="selectTab">我的挑战 · {{rewards.available.length}}</button><button class="segment {{tab === 'claims' ? 'active' : ''}}" data-tab="claims" bindtap="selectTab">已领取 · {{rewards.claims.length}}</button></view><block wx:if="{{tab === 'available'}}"><view wx:if="{{!rewards.available.length}}" class="card section"><view class="empty"><text class="empty-title">下一份礼物，正在路上</text>报名一个小挑战，让努力慢慢开花。</view><button class="btn soft" data-url="/pages/challenges/index" bindtap="go">去看看挑战 ↗</button></view><view wx:for="{{rewards.available}}" wx:key="id" class="card list-gap"><view class="row"><view class="icon-box gold"><image class="icon" src="/images/ui/gift.svg"/></view><view class="grow"><view class="title">{{item.rewardDays}} 天模拟会员体验卡</view><text class="small-text">{{item.title}}</text></view></view><view class="row mt"><text class="small-text">{{item.progress}} / {{item.days}} 天 · {{item.statusLabel}}</text><button class="btn small {{item.canClaim ? '' : 'soft'}}" data-url="/pages/activity/index?id={{item.id}}" bindtap="go">{{item.canClaim ? '去领取 ↗' : '查看进度 ›'}}</button></view></view></block><block wx:else><view wx:if="{{!rewards.claims.length}}" class="card section"><view class="empty"><text class="empty-title">这里，留给坚持的你</text>完成挑战后，记得领取你的奖励。</view><button class="btn soft" data-url="/pages/challenges/index" bindtap="go">开启我的挑战</button></view><view wx:for="{{rewards.claims}}" wx:key="id" class="card list-gap"><view class="row"><view class="icon-box gold"><image class="icon" src="/images/ui/gift.svg"/></view><view class="grow"><view class="title">{{item.days}} 天模拟会员体验卡</view><view class="small-text">{{item.title}}</view></view><text class="pill">已领取</text></view><view class="divider"></view><view class="small-text">领取日期 {{item.date}}</view><view class="small-text mt-sm">生效 {{item.start}} 至 {{item.end}} 00:00（北京时间）</view><button class="btn soft mt" data-url="/pages/membership/index" bindtap="go">查看会员权益 ›</button></view></block></block><button class="btn soft section" data-url="/pages/full-rewards/index" bindtap="go">活动、邀请、榜单与实物奖励 ›</button><view class="notice section">此处奖励为模拟会员权益，不产生真实发奖或交易。</view>
</block><view class="footnote">轻动 · 每一步坚持，都值得被看见</view></view>
